Natural Earth base map layers (land, lakes, rivers) in this directory are
derived from Natural Earth 1:10m physical vectors, which are in the public
domain. No permission is needed to use Natural Earth; credit is appreciated.
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

The clipping and simplification (scripts/build-basemap.py) is released under
the MIT licence of this repository.
